desc = " Uwa ~~~!!! The Magical Girl has descended from above to bring love and friendship to the land of Ander Dingus! (˶˃ ᵕ ˂˶) .ᐟ.ᐟ Watch as she unlocks her true form throughout the battle <3! Oh… what’s happening? Ẅ̷̛̰̥̦͇̩͎͇́̂̃̐̉̔͛h̴̢̨͕͈́̔͑̽͂̓̎͘͠ȅ̵̢̛̗̘̙̟͙̗̳̜͍̅̂̓͌̕ŕ̴͓̞͉̾́̐͗̈́̽̆̔͠e̷̙̫̪̯͑͛̈̿'̶̱͊͊̅͑̂d̵͇͉̦́̋ ̴̬͚́s̷̨̪͇̳͎͔̽͆ͅh̸̨͍̲̪̩̱̯̄͜e̸͇̟̺͌͛ ̴̨̢͇̥͈̜̰̗͚̳̾͒̍̑̾͗̓̋g̵̡̢̡̛̻̣̟̮̤̲̋̿̀̏̑͐̕o̸̢̫̣̅͊͐́́̾̈́͝?̸͔̲̮̼̰̗̬̇̐̿̇̓̇ ̵̨̡̯͍̖̭̺̳̹́̔̅͝W̸̧͙̪̖̥̦͙̲̓͌̉̔̽̃̓͝͝h̵̛̜͍͔̪̀͌͒͑͗͑͂̑͜a̴̜̞͂͑͑̍̍́̚ṫ̴̢̢̢̖̺̜̤͙͗̃̈́̈͑̓ͅ'̵͎̭͎̥̎̏͌̈̑͂̕̕͝s̴̢̺̼̱̟̔͆̎͐̽̍̓̍ ̵̛̤̜̏̓̈́́̋̀h̵̤̬͚̝̤̉͛̿̀̆̆̐a̵̧̮̞̞͍̰̱̘̅̍̇p̷̳͇̩̪͆̽͋͐̓͝͝͝p̷̛̻̺̲̝͓̈́̏̉̎̈́̾͊̚e̸̤̞͈͍̼͆̔̀ͅͅn̴̹̲͙͇̠̲̅̎ͅî̶̧͉̳͔̖͋̔̃͑͐̀̚͠ṋ̶̳̙̠̲̅̿͂̓͠g̵̢̙̳̘̟̞͍̼̿͊?̵̱͆̾̆͋͗̋̀̀̕ ̷̡̛̛͓͈͊͊̍̔͂͘M̴̡͇̞͚͍̉̂́̋̌̏̃ͅa̷̡͓̭͉̱͈̝͉͐͗̈́̎͝͝k̸̰̘̭͉͉̺̇͊̎̀̑͐̑͜͠e̵̛͕̭͋̃̔̓́ ̶͔͓͕̓̾̈́͆̀i̶̙̟̭̽̋͋t̶͎̠̫͌̃̃ ̷̳̼̍̇̚Ṡ̸̗̻̅̀ͅt̸̡̲̙̼̓͑̉͆̐ǭ̷̛̯͔̲̙̩̇̎͐̍͑̅ͅp̷̡̨͉̞̫̱̹̠̃͜ ̴̟̯̙̭̟̅͝ͅP̸͇̻̺̝̳̦̞̏̽l̴͉̭̯̽ḛ̷̢̢͉̪̬̰̗̪́̇͑̾ͅǎ̴̳̪̮̞̟̦́͑͋̿̇̚͠͝s̶̢̳̙͉̬̫̒̓̾̈́́̅́̄̈́͠ḙ̸͇͉͛͒͘ ̴̡̓̔͐̒S̴̺̺̫̩̺̞͎͒̈́͐̕t̵̲̬̅̒ǫ̸̱̝̤͇͉̞̥̺̏̐̾p̴͔̹͔͖̘̾̍̔͒̏͆́ ̴̛͇̮̘̺̗̗̣̦͒́͛͋̉͠͝ͅṔ̸̛̻̠̒͋̔́̍͝l̵̗̮̀̄͐̎̈́̈́̊̃͋͝ȩ̵̡̦̻͉̯̯̪̗͑̓̑̔̆̾̎͌͝a̶̧͇̼̥͓͍̪̕͜ͅs̶̡̻̼̬͎͔̣̪̋̀͗̇̌͗̇̆͘͝ȩ̶̜͕̝̼̬̩́̐̀̐͜ ̶̡̢̩͉̾̈̒͗͋̔̒́P̴̰̩̩̬̋͐̀̈̈́̚͘l̷̝͒̐́̍e̶͕̰̬̮͙̗̽̈͛̀̾̓̔̚͝ą̴͓̦̰̤̬͒̈́̉̓̈́̚̕͘͝s̸̡̱̘̬͍͙͙͗ȩ̸̨̼̰͙̳̪͇̖͓̾̈́
